  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "What the closure slice actually implements",
      "items": [
        "ResolvedCase → deterministic closure-evidence evaluator → EvaluateCaseClosure → deterministic REUSE / IMPROVE / CREATE / NO_ACTION policy.",
        "Knowledge retrieval, coverage evaluation and decision persistence are contracts only in this Resolve slice; no concrete adapters are shown as implemented."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "What the article slice actually implements",
      "items": [
        "Typed request → deterministic query/access request → KnowledgeChunkRetriever port → EvidenceRef-rich excerpts → provider-neutral generator port.",
        "A concrete LangChain adapter selects one fixed schema, builds E1..EN aliases, invokes an injected structured model and constructs KnowledgeArticleDraft."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Grounding boundary",
      "items": [
        "Duplicate or unknown evidence aliases fail deterministically; every persisted claim, step and gap carries stable EvidenceRef objects.",
        "Reference validity is not semantic entailment. A valid E1 citation proves identity, not that the cited chunk supports the generated sentence."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Resolve does not hard-code a retrieval strategy",
      "items": [
        "Resolve depends on KnowledgeChunkRetriever. BM25, exact dense and RRF hybrid are shared Core adapters/composition choices outside the capability.",
        "Business context influences prompt inputs but the deterministic retrieval query uses subject, product, optional module and explicit retrieval keywords."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Not implemented on current main",
      "items": [
        "Case taxonomy/classification, workflow routing, Next Best Action, article review/approve/publish lifecycle and agent/self-service UI are not drawn as runtime components.",
        "The Knowledge Article deterministic evaluation dataset/graders remain outside current main until QE-102 is merged."
      ]
    }
  ]
